{"id":"n40636-1-3","stage":4,"title":"꼬르륵 · 咕噜噜","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40636-1-3-1","ko":"배에서 꼬르륵 소리가 나는데 우리 뭐 좀 먹고 하자.","zh":"我肚子咕咕叫了，我们找点东西吃吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배에서","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배에서","audio":"/audio/4957a943cb68102e26ff.mp3"}},{"text":"꼬르륵","meaning":"咕噜噜","explanation":"꼬르륵：咕噜噜","readings":[{"term":"꼬르륵","audio":"/audio/4394a9e9863229e3dd2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40636","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼬르륵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼬르륵","audio":"/audio/4394a9e9863229e3dd2b.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"나는데","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는데","audio":"/audio/38bceaf18f2d7fee5937.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹고","audio":"/audio/b2dca7d94e3e3049878e.mp3"}},{"text":"하자.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하자","audio":"/audio/04b9b32cf095cdd41c5b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"船","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"29729","definition":"运载人或东西，在水上行驶的交通工具。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"4394a9e9863229e3","term":"꼬르륵","zh":"咕噜噜","audio":"/audio/4394a9e9863229e3dd2b.mp3","entryId":"40636","definition":"由于肚子饿或消化不良，肚子里发出叽里咕噜声。","pronunciation":["꼬르륵"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c8fb68561d2605f47804.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40636-1-3-2","ko":"그래. 배가 많이 고팠나 보구나.","zh":"好啊，看来你饿得很厉害呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"腹部","explanation":"배：腹部；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"2","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"고팠나","meaning":"饿，饥饿","explanation":"고프다：饿，饥饿；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"고프다","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18396","senseId":"1","lemma":"고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고팠나","audio":"/audio/67c5c064061bd9307c51.mp3"}},{"text":"보구나.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보구나","audio":"/audio/63677854531485540e78.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"3d0af87e12fd988a","term":"배","zh":"腹部","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3","entryId":"20211","definition":"人或动物的身体中消化食物的肠胃等内脏所在的部位。","pronunciation":["배"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"a55fb1c7a8a68fcb","term":"고프다","zh":"饿，饥饿","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3","entryId":"18396","definition":"肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["고프다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f55c405adf47be173e89.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.885,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40636","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好啊，看来你饿得很厉害呢。","我肚子咕咕叫了，我们找点东西吃吧。","你知道裕敏最近为什么没来学校吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我肚子咕咕叫了，我们找点东西吃吧。","你知道裕敏最近为什么没来学校吗？","好啊，看来你饿得很厉害呢。"],"answer":2}]}
